  "description": "Our protagonist is a secret fan of the idol 'Leon'. At school, while acting as a model student and continuing her fan outbursts concealed to meet her parents' expectations, 'Kang Seoseo', who looks exactly like his idol, arrives at the school.  \nSeoseo starts to annoy her by consistently imitating 'Leon'...\n\nThe story of their immature growth as they begin to approach each other's untouchable territory.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=795927), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8529616)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0002670)",
